---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Services | Fabriant
description: Release reliability, secure AKS and DevSecOps, Azure foundations, AI production readiness and specialist capacity. Five ways Fabriant helps, each tied to a problem your business already feels.
permalink: /services/
---
      <section id="offerings" class="page-top">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h1>What we do</h1>
          <p>Five ways we help, each tied to a problem your business already feels.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cards offering-cards">
          {%- for offering in offerings %}
          <div class="card offering" id="{{ offering.id }}">
            <h3>{{ offering.name }}</h3>
            <p class="offering-value">{{ offering.value }}</p>
            <ul class="list">
              {%- for point in offering.points %}
              <li><span class="dot"></span>{{ point }}</li>
              {%- endfor %}
            </ul>
            <p class="offering-start"><strong>{{ offering.startLabel }}</strong> {{ offering.start }}</p>
          </div>
          {%- endfor %}
        </div>
        <p class="section-note"><strong>Start small, scale with confidence.</strong> Each offering can begin as a focused sprint and grow into an ongoing engagement.</p>
        <p class="small-print">Not included in the sprints: large migrations, 24x7 operations, penetration testing, formal certification audits, and reservation or savings-plan purchases.</p>
        <div class="section-actions">
          <a class="cta-secondary" href="/how-to-start/">See how to start</a>
        </div>
      </section>
